            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "vocabqueen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "OMG -- OUTSTANDING!! I took a Short Cut @ the 3rd time I made it and I use 'Italian' Seasoning now. 1/2 Cup of Olive Oil, 1 Heaping TBSP of Minced Garlic, 1 tsp of Italian Seasoning, Salt &amp; Pepper. I use it on homemade Breads, Rolls and found a wonderful discovery -- I marinade my Veggies in it then skewer it up for the BBQ. My Husband doesn't really like Veggies but requests these OFTEN!! Love that!! Our Grown Up Son &amp; Daughter loved them too :)"
          },
